<title>FRANCE: Scor sees 5-10 mln Ffr Chunnel fire cost.</title>
<headline>Scor sees 5-10 mln Ffr Chunnel fire cost.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Re-insurance group Scor said that its costs of Monday's fire in the Eurotunnel SA/Plc cross-Channel rail tunnel would be between five and 10 million francs.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company gave the range to Reuters after the company's share fell by 1.53 percent to 187 francs on the Paris Bourse on fears about the extent of the pay-out.  </p>
<p>&quot;This incident is a normal event for Scor. It will cost us between five and 10 million franc,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
